@startuml mrd244_parallel_orchestrator
title MRD-244: ParallelOrchestrator Persistence Fix (NightShift)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFACD
skinparam noteBorderColor #DAA520

class ParallelOrchestrator {
  + store : Store
  + config : Config
  + max_workers : Optional[int]
  + output_qc : Dict[Tuple[str,int], AnomalyReport]
  --
  + prepare(targets : Sequence[StationYear]) : List[PreparedRun]
  + run(prepared : List[PreparedRun], run_at : datetime) : Tuple[List[Modelled], List[RunOutcome]]
  + persist(modelled : List[Modelled], run_at : datetime) : Dict[Tuple[str,int], Modelled]
}

note right of ParallelOrchestrator::persist
  <b>MRD-244 fix</b>
  Before: collected keyed by <i>stnid</i> alone
    -> last station-year written clobbers earlier years
  After: keyed by <i>(stnid, year)</i>
    -> every station-year persisted independently
end note

class PreparedRun <<dataclass>> {
  + target : StationYear
  + spec : ModelInputSpec
  + stnid : str
  + year : int
}

class Modelled <<dataclass>> {
  + target : StationYear
  + result : ForecastResult
  + summary : SeasonSummary
  + elapsed_s : float
  + deck_days : int
}

class StationYear <<dataclass>> {
  + stnid : str
  + year : int
}

class Store {
  + write_forecast(result : ForecastResult) : None
}

class Config {
  + targets : List[StationYear]
  + max_workers : Optional[int]
}

ParallelOrchestrator --> Store : uses
ParallelOrchestrator --> Config : reads
ParallelOrchestrator ..> PreparedRun : produces in prepare()
ParallelOrchestrator ..> Modelled : collects in persist()
Modelled --> StationYear : target
PreparedRun --> StationYear : target

@enduml
